@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# Axiom policy
+
+Allowed axioms: `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`.
+No exceptions. New exceptions require explicit release-owner approval, an exact name,
+approval date, reason and removal plan. Do not use native evaluation to prove
+theorems. `archive/` is historical, excluded from Lake roots, and never imported.
